  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensuring access to public interest content in Myanmar in a time of crisis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action aims to ensure audiences in Myanmar continue to have access to relevant, reliable and inclusive public interest content by providing support and assistance to exile media and journalists.</narrative>
